                    "learner_level": "C2",
                    "frequency": "Low",
                    "semantic_group_id": "emotion",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The sudden criticism did not seem to <w>phase</w> him at all.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "Внезапная критика, казалось, совсем его не <w>смутила</w>.",
                                "zh": "突如其来的批评似乎一点也没有<w>使</w>他<w>不安</w>。"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "She was not <w>phased</w> by the difficult questions during the interview.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "Ее не <w>смутили</w> сложные вопросы во время интервью.",
